    "intro_narrative": "You have breached the subterranean server levels of the Vanguard Syndicate. The facility is on high alert, and the security grid will lock down in less than an hour. Your mission is to infiltrate the core mainframe, bypass the multi-layered encryption protocols, and extract the encrypted ledger detailing their illegal operations. You are surrounded by humming servers, flickering screens, and heavy biometric safes. The syndicate uses a complex web of archive extractors, cryptographic calculators, and cipher modules to protect their data. You must follow the digital breadcrumbs, activate the dormant terminals, and route the data through the correct decryptors to finally compress the extracted payload for exfiltration. Be careful, as every module depends on the precise input from another. The clock is ticking, and the network is watching.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
